 "review": {
  "management_type_reason": "NC State・品種・MBG・種: 新枝咲きなので晩冬〜春に強く剪定できる。おぎはらの「花後から冬まで剪定可能」は時期の幅の話で、花後の切り戻しを勧める文ではないと読んだ。機械は空欄",
  "management_type_quote": "It can be severely pruned in late winter or spring as it blooms on the current season's new growth, not on the woody stems formed during the previous year.",
